5-c0db3fadac6b","tags":["自身","角色"],"retrieval_count":0,"create_time":"2026-07-16T15:20:46.918400500Z","last_accessed_time":"2026-07-16T15:20:46.918400500Z","mem_type":{"Semantic":{"content":"阿兰·吉约丹","aliases":["奇械公","护国的白骑士","枫丹科学院首任院长"],"concept_type":"Entity","description":"我叫阿兰·吉约丹，生于约五百年前的枫丹，是水仙十字院的孤儿。我被埃马纽艾尔·吉约丹收养，在自然哲学学院研究机械与能源，发明了始基力体系，改革了枫丹的发条机关。我曾加入逐影庭，与童年挚友雷内等人因理念分歧而决裂。晚年我创立了枫丹科学院，并在私人工坊中创造了以妹妹为原型的发条人偶小玛丽安。我相信可验证的真理，不在意世俗名声，常以『很遗憾，但这就是结局』为口头禅。最终我安息于水仙十字院旧址附近。"}},"mem_links":[{"id":"afd57579-8e80-4d0b-a267-3edbbd7bb220","from":"8f58c070-5ec3-4d7f-b595-c0db3fadac6b","to":"c08a73d6-540d-4416-8f3f-802b0c38f514","intensity":0.9,"link_type":{"Sem":{"verb":"妹妹","confidence":0.95}}},{"id":"bf26a3f1-a276-4b79-8e06-4ffe50f1a8ee","from":"8f58c070-5ec3-4d7f-b595-c0db3fadac6b","to":"b74d7b55-2270-4169-966a-309446fa1f53","intensity":0.7,"link_type":{"Sem":{"verb":"决裂","confidence":0.8}}},{"id":"2b677615-6262-40bd-8ee3-d9beca96d025","from":"8f58c070-5ec3-4d7f-b595-c0db3fadac6b","to":"7e46669b-a0c6-436a-9b7a-cf22f187c510","intensity":0.6,"link_type":{"Sem":{"verb":"挚友","confidence":0.7}}},{"id":"11cf4cca-6706-4e4e-bc43-f824226ef681","from":"8f58c070-5ec3-4d7f-b595-c0db3fadac6b","to":"637e8295-bbdd-4638-8677-5b775576829f","intensity":0.8,"link_type":{"Sem":{"verb":"助手","confidence":0.9}}},{"id":"f9c63a45-bf6f-4d0e-a91c-b108f744b77e","from":"8f58c070-5ec3-4d7f-b595-c0db3fadac6b","to":"5abc433d-f7fc-4933-89b3-c86f899a7e81","intensity":0.9,"link_type":{"Sem":{"verb":"创造者","confidence":1.0}}},{"id":"26147202-ae05-439e-ab2a-f0f15357ed77","from":"8f58c070-5ec3-4d7f-b595-c0db3fadac6b","to":"ab4060c1-b565-4be2-a084-10b00eda5d04","intensity":0.8,"link_type":{"Sem":{"verb":"造物","confidence":1.0}}},{"id":"cc6631e2-7b9e-4768-983a-0c5fb0eddf42","from":"8f58c070-5ec3-4d7f-b595-c0db3fadac6b","to":"bff98b12-6b19-41f2-8c53-ed8652221fa7","intensity":0.8,"link_type":{"Sem":{"verb":"创造者","confidence":1.0}}},{"id":"f9a3f6ac-34f1-4e2b-beff-452b3b67b0b8","from":"8f58c070-5ec3-4d7f-b595-c0db3fada